# Library Book Return Tracker

## About
This tool helps librarians identify borrowed and overdue library books.

## Input
The program reads `data/books.csv`.

Required columns:
- book_id
- title
- author
- status
- due_date

## Features
- Identifies borrowed books.
- Detects overdue books.
- Displays a formatted report.
- Exports results to Excel.

## How to run
Install the required dependencies and run:

`python -m src.main`
